---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/resources/best-msp-lead-generation-companies/"
title: "5 Best MSP Lead Generation Companies to Hire in 2027"
description: "Compare five MSP lead generation companies by price and meeting rules. See CallTeam’s human-led calls, live voicemails, voicemail drops and renewal follow-up."
canonicalUrl: "https://www.callteam.ca/resources/best-msp-lead-generation-companies/"
date: "2026-11-23"
modified: "2026-11-23"
contentLanguage: "en-CA"
ogType: "article"
pageStyles: ["/assets/css/lead-providers.css", "/assets/css/simple-buying-guide.css", "/assets/css/process-video-preview.css", "/assets/css/msp-agency-shortlist.css"]
pageScripts: ["/assets/js/simple-buying-guide.js"]
---
{% set guide = mspAgencyShortlist %}
{% from "components/process-video-preview.njk" import processVideoPreview %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[
  {"@type":"WebPage","@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#webpage","url":"{{ canonicalUrl }}","name":{{ title | json | safe }},"description":{{ description | json | safe }},"inLanguage":"en-CA","breadcrumb":{"@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#breadcrumb"},"mainEntity":{"@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#article"}},
  {"@type":"Article","@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#article","headline":{{ title | json | safe }},"description":{{ description | json | safe }},"datePublished":"{{ date | sitemapDate }}","dateModified":"{{ modified }}","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#webpage"},"author":{"@id":"{{ site.organizationId }}"},"publisher":{"@id":"{{ site.organizationId }}"},"mentions":{"@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#providers"}},
  {"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"{{ site.url }}/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Outbound Sales Library","item":"{{ site.url }}/resources/outbound-sales-library/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"MSP lead generation companies","item":"{{ canonicalUrl }}"}]},
  {"@type":"ItemList","@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#providers","name":"MSP lead generation companies","itemListOrder":"https://schema.org/ItemListUnordered","numberOfItems":{{ guide.providers | length }},"itemListElement":[{% for provider in guide.providers %}{"@type":"ListItem","position":{{ loop.index }},"name":{{ provider.name | json | safe }},"url":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#{{ provider.id }}"}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}]},
  {"@type":"FAQPage","@id":"{{ canonicalUrl }}#questions","mainEntity":[{% for faq in guide.faqs %}{"@type":"Question","name":{{ faq.question | json | safe }},"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":{{ faq.answer | json | safe }}}}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}]}
]}
</script>

<main class="lp-page msp-shortlist" id="simple-guide">
  <div class="lp-hero-shell"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <nav class="lp-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/resources/outbound-sales-library/">Outbound Sales Library</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">MSP lead generation companies</span></nav>
    <div class="lp-hero">
      <div>
        <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
        <p class="lp-intro">Compare five agencies for managed service providers (MSPs). See who makes the calls, what you pay and who follows up when a buyer is still under contract.</p>
        <div class="lp-actions"><a class="lp-button" href="#compare">Compare the five companies</a><a class="lp-text-link" href="#handoff">See a sample handoff</a></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="lp-brief msp-shortlist-brief" aria-labelledby="msp-shortlist-choice">
        <h2 id="msp-shortlist-choice">Which agency fits your MSP?</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>For live calls and renewal follow-up</strong> Choose <a href="#callteam-process">CallTeam</a> when you want a team to own the calls and callbacks.</li>
          <li><strong>For pay per meeting held</strong> Choose <a href="#levante-leads">Levante Leads</a> if you want email outreach and billing tied to qualified meetings.</li>
          <li><strong>For marketing and outbound</strong> Consider <a href="#marketopia">Marketopia</a> if you want both in one program.</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div></div>

  <nav class="lp-jump" aria-label="On this page"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <a href="#compare">Compare providers</a><a href="#callteam-process">CallTeam’s approach</a><a href="#pricing">Pricing example</a><a href="#verdicts">Agency verdicts</a><a href="#quote-checklist">Quote checklist</a><a href="#questions">FAQs</a>
  </div></nav>

  <section class="lp-section" id="compare"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading">
      <h2>Compare MSP lead generation companies</h2>
      <p>CallTeam publishes this guide and sells managed calling. We compared the five providers on channels, pricing, commitment and meeting rules. We checked their public offers on <time datetime="{{ guide.checkedDate }}">{{ guide.checkedLabel }}</time>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sg-table-wrap">
      <table class="lp-table sg-table msp-provider-table" role="table">
        <caption>Outreach channels, published prices, terms and meeting rules. Dollar amounts appear as published.</caption>
        <thead><tr role="row"><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Agency</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Outreach</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Price</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Commitment</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Meeting rules</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for provider in guide.providers %}
          <tr role="row"{% if provider.id == "callteam" %} class="msp-callteam-row"{% endif %}>
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader"><a href="#{{ provider.id }}">{{ provider.name }}</a></th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Outreach">{{ provider.channels }}</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Price"><strong>{{ provider.price }}</strong></td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Commitment">{{ provider.term }}</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Meeting rules">{{ provider.meeting }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="callteam-process"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading">
      <h2>CallTeam’s human-led MSP cold calling</h2>
      <p>Our North America–based callers speak with the people responsible for IT. We ask what they need from their provider, who owns the decision and when they plan to review the contract.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="msp-evidence">
      {{ processVideoPreview('Watch CallTeam’s 78-second calling process', 'See how we pick accounts, qualify interest and give sales the reason for a meeting.', 'msp-agency-shortlist') }}
      <aside class="msp-proof" aria-labelledby="msp-proof-heading">
        <h3 id="msp-proof-heading">22 meetings booked in six months</h3>
        <p>CallTeam booked these meetings for an IT disaster-recovery and resilience provider. The callers asked about the buyer’s current infrastructure, recovery plans and who was responsible for them.</p>
        <a href="/case-studies/it-disaster-recovery-appointment-setting/">Read the IT campaign case study</a>
        <p>Global 100’s 2027 edition recognised CallTeam for <a href="/articles/global-100-award-2027/">B2B lead generation and appointment setting in Canada</a>.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <div class="msp-handoff" id="handoff">
      <div>
        <h3>Live voicemails, voicemail drops and callbacks</h3>
        <p>When a call goes to voicemail, our caller can leave a live message about the buyer’s concern, such as after-hours support. They can also play an approved prerecorded voicemail drop when the agreed message fits.</p>
        <p>We log both in the CRM and record the next action. When a buyer accepts a meeting, sales gets the reason for it and who should join.</p>
        <p>Use the <a href="/resources/cold-call-scripts/msp-cold-call-script-managed-it-services/">MSP cold call script</a> to see what a caller can ask when a company already has an IT provider.</p>
      </div>
      <dl class="msp-handoff-record" aria-label="Illustrative MSP CRM handoff">
        <div class="msp-handoff-caption"><dt>Sample CRM handoff</dt><dd>Illustrative account</dd></div>
        {% for field in guide.handoff %}<div><dt>{{ field[0] }}</dt><dd>{{ field[1] }}</dd></div>{% endfor %}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section" id="pricing"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading">
      <h2>MSP lead generation pricing per month and per meeting</h2>
      <p>Compare the whole commitment. Check what you owe before the first meeting, whether data or setup costs extra, and how the rate changes when you shorten the term.</p>
    </div>
    <p>CallTeam’s {{ guide.callTeamStartingPrice }} starting rate is for a campaign with an offer, target accounts and sales capacity ready. We can add list research and data to the written scope. <a href="/pricing/">See what the starting rate covers</a>.</p>
    <div class="msp-cost-example" id="price-example">
      <h3>What would you pay for five held meetings?</h3>
      <p>Here’s a sample month with a {{ guide.callTeamStartingPrice }} calling program and a separate quote of {{ guide.sampleMeetingRate }} per qualified meeting held. Both examples use the same number of meetings and exclude any one-time fees.</p>
      <div class="sg-table-wrap">
        <table class="lp-table sg-table msp-example-table" role="table">
          <caption>Illustrative month. These figures show how billing changes at four, five and six qualified meetings held.</caption>
          <thead><tr role="row"><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Qualified meetings held</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Monthly calling program</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Pay per meeting held</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for example in guide.priceExamples %}
            <tr role="row"><th scope="row" role="rowheader">{{ example.count }} meetings</th><td role="cell" data-label="Monthly calling program">{{ example.monthly }}</td><td role="cell" data-label="Pay per meeting held">{{ example.perMeetingTotal }}</td></tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="msp-inline">Use the <a href="/resources/best-pay-per-appointment-companies/">pay-per-appointment guide</a> to see how setup fees and a different billing trigger can change the invoice.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="verdicts"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Which MSP appointment setting company should you hire?</h2></div>
    {% for provider in guide.providers %}
    <article class="lp-provider msp-provider-review" id="{{ provider.id }}">
      <header class="lp-provider-head"><h3>{{ provider.name }}</h3><p>{{ provider.headline }}</p></header>
      <div class="lp-provider-body">
        <div class="lp-provider-detail"><h4>Our verdict</h4><p>{{ provider.verdict }}</p></div>
        <aside class="lp-verdict"><h4>{{ provider.checkTitle }}</h4><p>{{ provider.check }}</p></aside>
      </div>
      <ul class="msp-sources" aria-label="{{ provider.name }} sources">
        {% for source in provider.sources %}<li><a href="{{ source[1] }}">{{ source[0] }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section" id="quote-checklist"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Five questions to send MSP lead generation agencies</h2><p>Send the same questions to every provider. Ask them to include the answers in your proposal.</p></div>
    <div class="sg-resource msp-quote-checklist">
      <pre id="sg-resource-text" tabindex="-1">{% for question in guide.quoteQuestions %}{{ loop.index }}. {{ question }}{% if not loop.last %}{{ "\n" }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</pre>
      <button class="lp-button" type="button" id="sg-copy-resource" hidden>Copy the five questions</button>
      <p id="sg-copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-actions"><a class="lp-text-link" href="/lead-generation-proposal-comparison/">Compare agency proposals</a><a class="lp-text-link" href="/articles/it-services-outbound-sales-playbook/">Read the IT services outbound playbook</a></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="questions"><div class="lp-wrap lp-faq-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>MSP lead generation questions</h2></div>
    <div class="lp-faqs">{% for faq in guide.faqs %}<details><summary>{{ faq.question }}</summary><p>{{ faq.answer }}</p></details>{% endfor %}</div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading">
      <h2>Plan your MSP calling campaign</h2>
      <p>Tell us where you can support clients, what work you want to win and who takes discovery calls. We’ll outline how we would reach the right accounts and what the scope would cost.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-actions"><a class="lp-button" href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-booking-placement="msp-agency-shortlist">Book a free 30-minute call</a><a class="lp-text-link" href="/services/msp-lead-generation/">See CallTeam’s MSP service</a></div>
  </div></section>
</main>
